BOUTS=[{'year':'2012','name':'Buchinger','src':'tracked/videos/2012-tracked.mp4','points':['Two kicks with recovery between them, followed later by a punch.','Watch the base change before the kick, then the withdrawing step.'],'take':'Mixed weapons with visible distance resets.'},{'year':'2013','name':'Holloway','src':'tracked/videos/2013-tracked.mp4','points':['Small shuffle → long step into punch → stance recovery.','After the entry, he withdraws; later pressure produces backward steps.'],'take':'Movement and punching are tightly coupled.'},{'year':'2018','name':'Nurmagomedov','src':'tracked/videos/2018-tracked.mp4','points':['Sampled standing exchange includes hand and leg attempts.','Feet are often obscured; don’t read the candidate skeleton as proof of planting.'],'take':'Opponent and visibility matter as much as the era.'},{'year':'2021','name':'Poirier II','src':'tracked/videos/2021-tracked.mp4','points':['Small foot adjustments precede an advancing punching sequence.','Late in this clip he keeps stepping toward the opponent at the fence.'],'take':'Punch-led pursuit; he is still actively moving.'}]
h='''<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>McGregor · Tracked eras</title><style>__CSS__</style></head><body><main><a href="../index.html">← Tracked MMA videos</a><div class="kicker" style="margin-top:24px">MCGREGOR / ACROSS ERAS</div><h1>Watch how the exchange changes.</h1><p>The strongest sampled difference is more kicking and distance resets early, versus punch-led pursuit in the later clips. A career-wide posture or timing change remains unproven.</p><div class="pair"><section class="player"><select id="left" aria-label="Left era"></select><video id="lv" controls muted playsinline preload="metadata"></video><aside class="points" id="lp"></aside></section><section class="player"><select id="right" aria-label="Right era"></select><video id="rv" controls muted playsinline preload="metadata"></video><aside class="points" id="rp"></aside></section></div><div class="controls"><button id="play">Play both</button><button id="replay">Replay both</button><select id="speed" aria-label="Playback speed"><option value="1">1× speed</option><option value=".5">0.5× speed</option><option value=".25">0.25× speed</option></select></div><div class="points"><h2>Three takeaways</h2><p>Strike selection gives the clearest lead: the reviewed windows reported punch/kick lower bounds of 8/4, 7/2, 7/1 and 6/0 across 2012, 2013, 2018 and 2021. Unequal short samples, not full-fight totals.</p><p>Later movement may support continued punching pressure, rather than simply becoming less mobile.</p><p>No monotonic stance-width or flat-footed trend was established. Wide and narrow stances occur within bouts; raised heels appear in both early and late anchors. Reaction speed and precise counter timing were not established.</p></div><p class="limit">Cyan: McGregor’s clothing role. Coral: opponent. Gray: unknown. Fresh visible-clothing anchors and gated temporal association; 133-point pose sampled at 6 Hz, displayed on native-rate video. Hidden joints remain candidates. The two clips show independent exchanges; synchronized relative playback has no tactical meaning.</p><footer>Four sampled bouts, different opponents and camera views. 2012–2021 is available study coverage, not career endpoints. <a href="four_bout/findings.txt">Read findings</a></footer></main><script>const DATA=__DATA__,$=id=>document.getElementById(id);let playing=false;function pause(){playing=false;$('lv').pause();$('rv').pause();$('play').textContent='Play both'}function choose(side){pause();let d=DATA[+$(side).value],v=$(side==='left'?'lv':'rv'),p=$(side==='left'?'lp':'rp');v.src=d.src;v.load();v.playbackRate=+$('speed').value;p.innerHTML='<span class="pill">'+d.year+' · '+d.name+'</span><h2>'+d.take+'</h2>'+d.points.map(t=>'<p>'+t+'</p>').join('')}for(let side of ['left','right']){$(side).innerHTML=DATA.map((d,i)=>'<option value="'+i+'">'+d.year+' · '+d.name+'</option>').join('');$(side).onchange=()=>choose(side)}$('right').value=3;choose('left');choose('right');async function play(){if(playing){pause();return}let a=$('lv'),b=$('rv');if(a.ended||b.ended){a.currentTime=0;b.currentTime=0}else{b.currentTime=a.currentTime}try{await Promise.all([a.play(),b.play()]);playing=true;$('play').textContent='Pause both'}catch(e){pause()}}$('play').onclick=play;$('replay').onclick=()=>{pause();$('lv').currentTime=0;$('rv').currentTime=0;play()};$('speed').onchange=()=>{for(let id of ['lv','rv'])$(id).playbackRate=+$('speed').value};for(let id of ['lv','rv'])$(id).onended=pause;function tick(){if(playing&&Math.abs($('lv').currentTime-$('rv').currentTime)>.12)$('rv').currentTime=$('lv').currentTime;requestAnimationFrame(tick)}tick();</script></body></html>'''.replace('__CSS__',CSS).replace('__DATA__',json.dumps(BOUTS))
